che a mapping (if one is\nL398:            needed) between watch descriptors and pathnames.  Be aware that\nL399:            directory renamings may affect multiple cached pathnames.\nL400: \nL401:            Inotify monitoring of directories is not recursive: to monitor\nL402:            subdirectories under a directory, additional watches must be\nL403:            created.  This can take a significant amount time for large\nL404:            directory trees.\nL405: \nL406:            If monitoring an entire directory subtree, and a new subdirectory\n"
